Package: SVDMx
Title: Child/Child-Adult Mortality-Indexed Model Mortality Age Schedules
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Samuel", "Clark", , "work@samclark.net", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Model age schedules of mortality, nqx, suitable for a life table. This package 
    implements the SVD-Comp mortality model indexed by either child or child/adult mortality. 
    Given input value(s) of either 5q0 or (5q0, 45q15), the qx() function generates 
    single-year 1qx or 5-year 5qx conditional age-specific probabilities of dying. 
    Calibrations from successive versions of the Human Mortality Database are included. 
    See Clark (2016) <doi:10.48550/arXiv.1612.01408> and Clark (2019) <doi:10.1007/s13524-019-00785-3>. 
URL: https://github.com/sinafala/SVDMx, https://github.com/sinafala/svd-comp
BugReports: https://github.com/sinafala/SVDMx/issues
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: graphics, grDevices, jsonlite, stats, utils, writexl
